      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your top-tier luxury fragrance consumers likely possess high disposable income, refined taste, and a strong sense of personal style. Demographically, they tend to be affluent, urban dwellers, often between the ages of 25 and 45. They value exclusivity, luxury, and bespoke experiences, aligning with the high-end branding. In terms of lifestyle, they may be frequent travelers, connoisseurs of fine art and fashion, and involved in philanthropic pursuits. Culturally, they tend to appreciate high-end design, sophisticated entertainment, and high-end events, making up 15-25% of high-income households.",
